Subject: [PATCH 035/194] sm120: use custom row topk for MQA fallback indices

Use the existing top_k_per_row_prefill CUDA op after the SM120 Triton MQA logits fallback materializes logits. The op writes int32 indices directly and respects row bounds, avoiding torch.topk plus int64-to-int32 copy in the long-context prefill path.

On RTX PRO 6000 TP=2, 127K C=1 cold TTFT mean improved from 37.65s to 36.87s with no short-context regression across C=1/2/4.

