#43477 added family-120 to CudaPlatform.support_deep_gemm, which selects the
DeepGEMM SM120 MXFP4 kernels. Those need the still-unmerged DeepGEMM PR #324; the
released/pinned DeepGEMM ref aborts at engine init on SM120 with a scale-factor
layout assertion (sf.size(-2) == ceil_div(mn, gran_mn)), so DSv4 fails to serve
on stock deps. Drop family-120 here so SM120 uses the Marlin/cutlass + sm12x
DeepGEMM-fallback path (matches pre-#43477 behavior). Re-enable when #324 lands.

